---
kind: lore
id: isles.trainers
title: Sunfall Isles trainers
---

// AREA isles: the island trainers (trainerBattle template) and their
// after-battle lines. Grunts are in the lens scenes; Ace Kestrel is the
// Battle Tower's.

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="emberkeyHikerRook" who="emberkeyHikerRook" intro="The mountain's warm today. So am I!" win="Cooled off." lose="Hot streak!" prize="1400"/>
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="emberkeyFirebreatherIda" when="@isNight" who="emberkeyFirebreatherIda" intro="Fire looks better in the dark." win="Snuffed out." lose="Whoosh!" prize="1500"/>
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="mistralBirdKeeperOwen" who="mistralBirdKeeperOwen" intro="My birds can ride this wind all day." win="Grounded." lose="Up, up, and away!" prize="1400"/>
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="mistralKiteFlyerJun" when="!@isNight" who="mistralKiteFlyerJun" intro="You walked into my kite string!" win="Tangled up." lose="Look at it fly!" prize="1300"/>
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="coralreachSwimmerTess" when="@islesLowTide" who="coralreachSwimmerTess" intro="The tide pools are my training pool." win="Wiped out." lose="Swam circles round you." prize="1400"/>
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="coralreachFishermanAbe" who="coralreachFishermanAbe" intro="Hooked one! Oh, it's a trainer." win="The one that got away." lose="Reeled in!" prize="1400"/>

<entry id="islesRookAfter" on="talk" target="npc.emberkeyHikerRook" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['emberkeyHikerRook'])">
  @emberkeyHikerRook: The whole island is a volcano. Nobody here minds.
</entry>
<entry id="islesIdaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.emberkeyFirebreatherIda" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['emberkeyFirebreatherIda'])">
  @emberkeyFirebreatherIda: Come back when the beacon's lit. It's the best fire on the island.
</entry>
<entry id="islesOwenAfter" on="talk" target="npc.mistralBirdKeeperOwen" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['mistralBirdKeeperOwen'])">
  @mistralBirdKeeperOwen: The windmill turns with the wind, or it's supposed to.
</entry>
<entry id="islesJunAfter" on="talk" target="npc.mistralKiteFlyerJun" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['mistralKiteFlyerJun'])">
  @mistralKiteFlyerJun: West wind today. It's always west wind.
</entry>
<entry id="islesTessAfter" on="talk" target="npc.coralreachSwimmerTess" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['coralreachSwimmerTess'])">
  @coralreachSwimmerTess: At high tide I swim over the cave. It's creepy.
</entry>
<entry id="islesAbeAfter" on="talk" target="npc.coralreachFishermanAbe" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['coralreachFishermanAbe'])">
  @coralreachFishermanAbe: The grunt in the cave? She fishes worse than me.
</entry>
